      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例题 2. 质量为$m=3$千克的小球，",
        "从高度$h=3$米落到固定在弹簧上的小",
        "台上（图 188），并压缩弹簧. 如果弹簧",
        "的弹性系数等于700牛顿/米，试求弹簧",
        "的最大压缩长度. 弹簧和小台的质量可"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 188",
      "box": [
        1082,
        324,
        302,
        349
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-188"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图 188",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "以忽略不计. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**解：**高度$h$和弹簧伸长量$l$是从小台算起（图 188）. 在",
        "小球落到小台上时，球的动能等于$\\frac{mv^2}{2}$. 在弹簧有最大压缩",
        "时，球的动能等于零，而它的势能等于$-m|\\vec{g}|l$. 在这个时刻，",
        "弹簧的势能最大，并等于$\\frac{kl^2}{2}$，根据能量守恒定律，",
        "$\\frac{mv^2}{2}=\\frac{kl^2}{2}-m|\\vec{g}|l$. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "但是，小球的动能$\\frac{mv^2}{2}$应当等于小球在高度$h$处所具有的",
        "势能：",
        "$\\frac{mv^2}{2}=m|\\vec{g}|h$. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，",
        "$m|\\vec{g}|h=\\frac{kl^2}{2}-m|\\vec{g}|l$. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解得到的这个二次方程，并把例题条件中的数据代入，则",
        "得到$l\\approx0.5$米. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
